sequenceDiagram
  actor F as Faculty
  participant UI as Attendance UI
  participant IDB as Dexie
  participant Q as Sync engine
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  F->>UI: Mark roster and save
  UI->>IDB: Write session + records + outbox
  UI-->>F: Pending (survives refresh)
  Q->>API: POST /api/v1/attendance/sync
  API->>API: Verify JWT and assignment
  alt same idempotency key
    API->>DB: Find existing session
    API-->>Q: 200 existing
    Q->>IDB: Mark synced
  else natural key taken different payload
    API-->>Q: 409 conflict
    Q->>IDB: Keep local, status conflict
  else ok
    API->>DB: Insert session+records txn
    API-->>Q: 201 created
    Q->>IDB: Mark synced
  else 5xx
    API-->>Q: error
    Q->>IDB: Keep local, status failed
  end
